n ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f sang C\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc thanh to\'e1n cho b\'ean b\'e1n, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc \u7913\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f cho c\'f4ng tr}{
