\par - B\u7843\'3fng k\'ea kh\u7889\'3fi l\'fd\u7907\'3fng x\'e2y l\u7855\'3fp ho\'e0n th\'e0nh c\'f3 x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa A, B. \'d0\'f5n gi\'e1 t\u7841\'3fm t\'ednh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f N\'e3ng l\'fd\u7907\'3fng ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft.

